  "question": {
    "text": "The sides of a triangle are $\\sin \\alpha, \\cos \\alpha$ and $\\sqrt{1+\\sin \\alpha \\cos \\alpha}$ for some $0 < \\alpha < \\frac{\\pi}{2}$. Then the greatest angle of the triangle is",
